# Day 32 – Think Like a Marketing Strategist

## 📌 Project Overview
Today I built **Think Like a Marketing Strategist: Grow This Brand**, an interactive marketing strategy simulator that teaches users how marketers think before creating content.

Unlike a content generator, this application focuses on strategic decision-making through an engaging learning experience.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🏢 Business Mode
- 🙋 Personal Brand Mode
- 🎲 Random Client Generator
- 👥 Audience Analysis
- 📱 Social Platform Selection
- 🎯 Content Pillar Selection
- 🗓️ 30-Day Marketing Roadmap
- ⚡ Random Marketing Events
- 📊 Final Growth Report
- 💡 Prompt Engineering Cards after every section
- 🌙 Modern Dark UI
- 📱 Fully Responsive
- ⚛️ Built using React (CDN) + Babel

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- React (CDN)
- Babel JSX

---

## 📚 What I Learned

- How marketers build strategy before creating content.
- Importance of audience research.
- Choosing platforms based on business goals.
- Building strong content pillars.
- Creating long-term marketing roadmaps.
- Handling unexpected marketing situations.
- Writing reusable prompts for Claude.

